# API (FastAPI + REST)

## Scope

REST only (no WebSocket in MVP). Live preview optional later via polled endpoints or separate stream.

## Network

- Local WLAN only; bind to Pi LAN interface.
- Auth: implement JWT or session auth, but `auth_enabled: false` in config skips auth for early testing.

## Core endpoints (MVP)

- `GET /api/detections?limit=100` — last N for review UI
- `GET /api/detections/{id}/image` — image with optional bbox overlay server-side or bbox JSON for client draw
- `GET/PUT /api/config/spray` — delay_ms, duration_ms, speed, camera_nozzle_distance
- `GET/PUT /api/config/mode` — test_mode, min_confidence
- `POST /api/training/sessions` — upload/register learning-drive video
- `GET /api/training/sessions/{id}/frames` — frame list for scrubbing
- `POST /api/training/annotations` — bbox + class per frame (JSON)

## Rules

- API never triggers spray directly; only updates config read by core.
- Use Pydantic models; OpenAPI at `/docs`.
- German error messages for UI-facing `detail` fields where user-visible.
